            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Diana Spencer</strong><br>\nDiana Spencer, known as Lady Diana before her marriage, was born on July 1, 1961, into an aristocratic British family with royal ancestry. She grew up in Park House, situated on the Queen's Sandringham Estate, and was educated at home until the age of nine. Later, she attended boarding school in Switzerland, where she excelled in music and dance but struggled academically. Diana's shy nature as a child was juxtaposed with a fondness for helping others, hinting at her future philanthropic endeavors.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Engagement to Prince Charles</strong><br>\nDiana's engagement to Prince Charles was announced in February 1981. Their relationship began in 1980 when Charles was dating her older sister, Lady Sarah. Diana was 19 years old at the time of the engagement, and Charles was 32. The engagement ring chosen by Diana was an 18-carat oval sapphire surrounded by diamonds, which became one of the most iconic pieces of jewelry in the royal collection.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Royal Wedding</strong><br>\nThe wedding of Diana and Charles took place on July 29, 1981, at St. Paul's Cathedral, witnessed by a global television audience of over 750 million people. Diana's wedding dress, made of ivory silk taffeta and antique lace, had a 25-foot train and was designed by David and Elizabeth Emanuel. The ceremony was a grand affair, marked by the pomp and circumstance befitting a royal union.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
